flowchart LR
  subgraph Inputs
    G[arXiv cs.CL 2020-2022<br/>.bib + .tex sources] -->|build_genuine_set.py| GR[genuine_refs.jsonl<br/>label: genuine]
    C[CiteTracer ICLR 2026 set] -->|load_positives.py| FR[fabricated_refs.jsonl<br/>807 citations]
  end
  GR --> RET
  FR --> RET
  subgraph Retrieval [one pass, then frozen]
    RET[run_retrieval.py] --> CR[(Crossref<br/>bibliographic + DOI)]
    RET --> AX[(arXiv<br/>ID + title)]
    RET --> OA[(OpenAlex<br/>DOI + title)]
    CR --> CACHE[(cache.sqlite)]
    AX --> CACHE
    OA --> CACHE
    CACHE --> CAND[candidates.jsonl]
  end
  CAND --> SC[score.py]
  SC --> V1E[V1E existence]
  SC --> V1F[V1F Eqs. 2-5]
  SC --> V2[V2 Naser]
  SC --> V3[V3 AtomGPT]
  SC --> V3a[V3a author veto]
  V1E & V1F & V2 & V3 & V3a --> EV[evaluate.py]
  EV --> M[FPR + Wilson CI<br/>recall<br/>PPV at pi Eq. 13]
  EV --> S[tau sweep<br/>FP by type and field]
  EV --> ADJ[adjudication sample<br/>labelled by hand]
  ADJ -->|--adjudication| EV
